        "text": "According to Donald E. Pinaud, Jr., according to Donald E. Pinaud, Jr., this case concerns whether removal jurisdiction for Fair Labor Standards Act (FLSA) claims should be narrowly construed under the rule of construction from Shamrock Oil."
